  "description": "The SCOTT Addict Gravel 30 delivers freedom to ride further with more confidence and comfort on gravel. Built for daily off-road riding or light bikepacking adventures, it’s ready to handle whatever your route throws at you with premium engineering, responsive and capable handling, and a proven build kit.\n\nKeeping you connected to the trail with balanced geometry and gravel-focused engineering is what the HMF carbon frame does best. It’s a smooth, responsive, comfortable ride, whether you’re exploring at a steady pace or pushing a little harder. That smooth control extends to the tires as well, with clearance for up to 57mm, high-volume tread for grip and stability on varied surfaces.\n\nPractical details make it even more versatile. The downtube storage keeps essentials like tools and spares within easy reach, while a discreet multitool fits neatly into the bar ends. Extra bottle-cage mounts on the fork ensure you stay hydrated, and a dedicated insert under the top tube accommodates a frame bag for longer rides or minimalist trips.\n\nThe SRAM Rival XPLR AXS drivetrain supplies the range for your route, delivering smooth, reliable shifting over a gravel-specific 10-46t cassette. Ergonomic hoods and one-finger braking reduce hand fatigue, so you can ride comfortably, even on marathon days or rolling descents.\n\nThe Addict Gravel 30 keeps you motivated, matches your thirst for off-road riding, and gives you the freedom to chase every adventure.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
